{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Search products"},"description":"Find products in a market by words or by an exact identifier (GTIN or model number). Every word must match the name, brand or category; a word of four or more letters matches as a prefix, so OLED55 finds OLED55C54LA; \u00e4, \u00f6, \u00fc, \u00df may be written ae, oe, ue, ss; a size unit after a number (55 Zoll, 55 inch) is ignored. On zero results, search again with fewer or broader words. Each result has product_url, its Tallybuy page comparing every offer, and its lowest delivered total and lowest item price; each quote names the seller, observed_at, currency, currency_exponent and purchase_url. Cite the seller and observed_at with every price. Null is unknown, never zero. purchase_url is a Tallybuy link; Tallybuy may earn a commission when someone buys, at no extra cost to them. Say so when you give the link. Results are candidates, not recommendations, and may include accessories. market_id, locale, currency and destination_country are required: take them from list_markets.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"brand_id":{"type":"string"},"currency":{"description":"Required: the market default_currency from list_markets","type":"string"},"cursor":{"description":"Opaque service cursor from the previous page","type":"string"},"destination_country":{"description":"Required: the market country_code from list_markets","type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"Default 10; maximum 50","type":"integer"},"locale":{"description":"Required: the market default_locale from list_markets","type":"string"},"market_id":{"description":"Required: active destination market UUID from list_markets","type":"string"},"q":{"description":"Deterministic text or exact identifier query","type":"string"}},"required":["q","market_id","locale","currency","destination_country"],"type":"object"},"name":"search_products","outputSchema":{"anyOf":[{"add